Replaces: picompose-audio-driver
Description: PiCompose driver for the ReSpeaker 2-Mics Pi HAT V2.0
 Device tree overlay for the ReSpeaker 2-Mics Pi HAT V2.0,
 which has a TLV320AIC3104 codec. The kernel already has the driver for the
 codec, so the package only needs the overlay that connects it to the I2S
 pins of the Raspberry Pi. It enables I2C and loads the overlay in the boot
 configuration, and adds a profile set for the sound card so that the volume
 of the sink controls the DAC of the codec.
 .
 The package provides picompose-audio-driver, so only one audio driver package
 can be installed.
